{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "acd4610d3a122b44c91b91f9048c363b85276af157bf4dc1644ad10f5fedfc2a", "ja": "（次の撮影で使う新しい衣装が届いた。\n恵美は、鳥の精霊役という事だけど……）", "zh": "（下一次拍摄要用的新服装送到了。\n听说恵美要演鸟的精灵，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "21aa86215d3ba51c244c6642dad5bfeb76230303cdf4e49fcc8d8be3276a7709", "ja": "うーん。うーん……？　この衣装を\nいいカンジに見せるには、どうしたらいいのかな～。", "zh": "嗯——嗯……？要怎样才能把这套服装展示得更有感觉呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1002_p", "source_sha256": "958476737e1f5bff5b55c42b7a5d757fed7cb8572d11e8ead743deaa4f065918", "ja": "お疲れさま、恵美。さっきから\nうなってるみたいだけど、何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，惠美。你从刚才开始就一直在苦恼，是遇到什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "856adf2adc6fcdbe0a052f0eb9ed7e5582edeeae10603935249f7f5ce20b61bd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。ううん、全然！\nすっごくカワイイと思うよ。ありがとね♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。没有，完全没事！\n我觉得特别可爱。谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "6ebb064c30ebd4588421d7c2610ec9f11ab72f6a921a2c4ab3d2cdfc9ddc1fbf", "ja": "ただ、衣装自体は気に入ってるんだけどさー。\n妖精？精霊？とか、どう演じればいいのかなーって。", "zh": "不过，我是喜欢这套服装啦——只是，妖精？精灵？之类的角色，该怎么演才好呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "a7fc64709607a9e605181ea2a7de59a749acf9d14bc12d9619b1cd5fd0c98eda", "ja": "自分で言うのもなんだけど……アタシって、\n妖精とか精霊のイメージじゃなくない？", "zh": "虽然这么说自己有点那个……但我不是那种很有妖精或精灵气质的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d0fe679d7818956d042e7e18f1124b6480bc05b6cadb842b73af582b4d18acb6", "ja": "そんな事はないと思うけど……。今回の\nキャスティングの打ち合わせには、俺も参加したし。", "zh": "我觉得并不是那样……这次的选角讨论，我也参加了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "9824a2f3409362a27f4fd06e7af1f40581b4c97f40772e0c362643aee34a8bd3", "ja": "え！？　そうなの、{$P$}！\nなんか、ますます気になるんだけど～！", "zh": "诶！？是这样吗，{$P$}！\n总觉得越来越在意了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "bf7560140229c4b0a45b749dd8bf80d89603f23b33c7398b5b6297dcacdde525", "ja": "だって精霊役が似合いそうな子なら、\n他にもいたと思わない？　なのに、なんで？", "zh": "因为如果是适合演精灵的女孩子，\n我觉得应该还有其他人吧？可为什么偏偏是我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1009_p", "source_sha256": "448e55f7414b965cc1283580ddc879ebc5074d7f5e27f792963075b617823e8c", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……恵美がいつも、そんな風に\nみんなの事をよく見てるからかな？", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……也许是因为惠美平时总是这样，仔细观察着大家吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "4093cff20f4d6ee61a643c366a84e5746d78c4d3959eb0a59cf0aac07aa7d597", "ja": "えっ……いつもの、アタシ？", "zh": "诶……平时的我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4032f3ec38cb6e0290e79052a5b35f7ce0c21f6ba37b60ab3bb78e8311a3f325", "ja": "うん。恵美ならきっと、新しい友達ができた時は\n自分達の輪に入れて一緒に楽しもうって言うだろうし。", "zh": "嗯。要是惠美的话，交到新朋友的时候，\n肯定会说把对方拉进大家的圈子一起开开心心地玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ca595a6125dc330a266eb818bdfa556fb1b3bfbbf0744f1464c45212c3cc5df4", "ja": "新しい友達ができたら、自分達の輪に入れて、\n楽しい場所に連れてって一緒に楽しむだろ？", "zh": "要是交到了新朋友，你也会把对方拉进大家的圈子里，\n带去好玩的地方一起开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "c9fb5678c9b5573fa9bbb1aab5bf1440714c80f6d2f6ff8cc3a9fb18b8837a6c", "ja": "まぁ、たしかにそうかも……？\n友達とか仲間は、大事だって思うし。", "zh": "嗯，确实也许是这样……？\n我觉得朋友和伙伴都很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cbd307bae72e8114d46f0d1db43c47ed6226a7a3b656e68a3b6a1a01b1b4aa89", "ja": "うん。だからそういう恵美に、今回の役は\nピッタリなんじゃないかって思ったんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。所以我觉得，这次的角色\n不是正适合这样的惠美吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "71b637df852da0c9efdc34042ae9fde0d1ad4fe62652d2badf81377f44c365ff", "ja": "あー、そっか……それで{$P$}は、\nアタシを選んでくれたんだ……。", "zh": "啊～，原来是这样……所以{$P$}\n才会选我啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "a60884353c5abf1daab96e6e72b54551597662c32498cd4e9e5c9c1c10eb0423", "ja": "なんか衣装とか雰囲気でばっか考えてたから、\n全然気づかなかったよー。アタシもまだまだだね！", "zh": "因为之前光顾着考虑服装和氛围什么的，完全没注意到这一点——我还差得远呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ea1ea3c785916f9d34663f8132adea2e7f4c1bc946ee4a528456b06a30467531", "ja": "だから、自信を持って大丈夫だ。衣装も、\n恵美のために作ったものだからな。", "zh": "所以，你尽管自信一点，没关系。服装也是专门为惠美制作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f6dfaca1e0c3add640f25bf084b9d37f1c9e1e7cc853cd173fe9f475bb8b5a56", "ja": "普段どおり、頑張ってくれ！\nそれがきっと、一番いい結果になるから。", "zh": "就像平时一样，加油吧！\n这样一定能得到最好的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "30d1eb16cf75f245b2efe7f9689bee5ab0ae548bc7a8ecae98e78b1b262c058a", "ja": "もう……そこまで言われちゃったら、がんばるしか\nないよね！　ま、ちょっとは自信ついたし……。", "zh": "真是的……话都说到这个份上了，\n我也只能加油啦！嘛，也多少有了点自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc575a0c3750480676a67e559b73df08a998529c5159ab8d471c1f3de1750e6e", "ja": "それじゃアタシが、{$P$}のコトも\n妖精の国に連れてっちゃうよ～？　なんて、にゃはは♪", "zh": "那我就把{$P$}也带去妖精国哦～？开玩笑啦，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_020meg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_020meg0184_1021_p", "source_sha256": "2170c639e78913f9422a92d80fd0c801927242e6b7aa969ac40883f90cb7a115", "ja": "（恵美の不安、少しは解消されたみたいだな。\nどんな世界に案内されるのか、今から楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（看来惠美的不安多少消除了些。真让人期待她接下来会带我去见识怎样的世界啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
